OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRather
OL,6,Fcloudy with some showers at first but
OL,7,Fthese soon fading out through the
OL,8,Fevening to allow some clearer spells.
OL,9,FMostly dry overnight but further
OL,10,Fshowers likely later.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FAny showers soon dying out.
OL,13,FThen the rest of the day will be dry
OL,14,Fwith variable amounts of cloud and
OL,15,Fbright spells.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FMainly
OL,18,Fdry although rather cloudy at times
OL,19,Fover the weekend, just a few light
OL,20,Fshowers across Argyll. Dry with more
OL,21,Fin the way of sunshine on Monday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
